{"data":{"body":"**P2:** The handler result has already won outcome selection here, but continuation admission remains open throughout serialization and oversized-result checkpointing. If an owned READY continuation fails concurrently, it selects retryable control through `executionExceptionFuture`, yet this callback continues to emit `SUCCEEDED` and return success. Call `beginInvocationEnd()` before output preparation, and add a test that blocks serialization or the large-payload checkpoint while a continuation fails.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7747t1","finding_digest":"eec259eaa6e55371ed3dd836b70177d6400c09efa88c99a28a4e59f0bd3c3039","finding_id":"arf_v1_53bft2vg4vjxd3j53a3loalx2z","finding_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::runcheckpointcontinuation::invocation-teardown-escape","identity_key":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanager.java::runcheckpointcontinuation::invocation-teardown-escape","line":181,"observation_digest":"41fed47e01b70fd05473c50fed0d4d716167d2735c9652e3512bcb2fdad4e54d","observation_id":"aro_v1_ih7ni7qbw4h5avdtyuh62dknof","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_53bft2vg4vjxd3j53a3loalx2z","published_at":"2026-10-09T02:18:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6rdsr4y6yxsdhqxuwhqq26hffu","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"098c9616109c156ebae9788081bf1f04e9293176","reviewer":"codex","start_line":181,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_vjv5xww7be3rtjollufpwkre7v","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T02:18:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
